# Associate Role (Entry-Level SEO Specialist)

## Responsibilities
• Support $5k - $15k in monthly client accounts
• Assist analysts with technical audits and implementations
• Basic on-page SEO optimization (titles, metas, headers)
• Content optimization support and keyword research
• Google Search Console monitoring and reporting
• Google Analytics 4 (GA4) basic reporting
• Link building outreach and relationship management
• Social media posting for SEO clients
• Monthly client reporting assistance

## Required Skills
• Understanding of SEO fundamentals (on-page, off-page, technical)
• Basic HTML/CSS knowledge
• Google Analytics 4 familiarity
• Google Search Console navigation
• Comfortable with Excel/Google Sheets
• Strong written communication
• Client service orientation
• Detail-oriented documentation

## Learning Path
• Technical audit fundamentals
• Core Web Vitals basics
• Structured data implementation
• Local SEO basics
• Link evaluation criteria
• AI-assisted content strategies
